WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.980
- [Narrator] In 2014,

00:00:04.511 --> 00:00:08.574
one of Norway's youngest
and most prolific explorers

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:12.324
attempted to summit the
world's tallest peak.

00:00:18.889 --> 00:00:21.295
- [Narrator] Only to end in failure.

00:00:21.295 --> 00:00:22.444
- [Cameraman] Whoa, whoa, whoa! Inside!

00:00:22.444 --> 00:00:24.317
- [Man] Close the door! Close the door!

00:00:24.317 --> 00:00:25.773
- [Narrator] One year later,

00:00:25.773 --> 00:00:27.889
Teodor and his team have returned

00:00:27.889 --> 00:00:30.222
to finish what they started.

00:00:34.753 --> 00:00:37.520
- [Narrator] Discovering the
limits of their own physical

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.520
and emotional endurance,

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:48.210
- [Narrator] to make their
dream of Everest a reality.

